available sizes: 152cm, 154cm, 156cm, 158cm, 156cm Wide, 159cm Wide
board type: Freestyle-All Mountain
rider level: Intermediate-Advanced
flex rating: 6/10
flex description: Mid-flex (balanced blend of flexibility and stiffness)
shape: Twin (symmetrical tip and tail)
camber type: Medium Camber with 3BT and Sidekick 2.0
nose sidebase uplift: Low
tail sidebase uplift: Low
base technology: Triple Base Technology (3BT) (reduces edge-catch while maintaining ollie power and carving control)
edge technology: SideKick (amplifies sidebase uplift beyond widest points of nose and tail for hull-like shape, enhances float in deep snow, improves turn initiation)
sidecut type: Tri Radial (smooth and quick edge transitions with fewer catches)
width options: Standard, Wide
mounting pattern: 2x4 Inserts
laminate: Bi-Ax, Carbon Stringers, C.S.T. SuperTubes
laminate detail - Bi-Ax: Bi-Axial fibreglass, lightweight, strong, and playful with torsional stiffness
laminate detail - Carbon Stringers: strategically placed carbon layups to fine-tune flex, response, and feel
laminate detail - C.S.T. SuperTubes: Central SuperTube, lightweight hollow carbon cylinder running down middle to boost pop while maintaining torsional flex
core: Light Core (50/50 blend of Poplar and Paulownia, strong and lively, balanced for all mountain riding)
base: Ultra Glide S (premium 7000-grade sintered base, ultra-dense P-tex, exceptional speed and durability)
sidewall construction: HyCap Construction (durable polyurethane sidewalls in tip and tail for impact resistance, full cap through contact length for reduced weight with enhanced edge grip and stability)
pro rider association: Ethan Morgan, Halldór Helgason
shipping restriction: Australia only
